    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is covered under the sugar?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hidden dark sides to fairy tales told all over the world. <br>This game presents a new story based on \u201cHansel and Gretel\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/b04e52e2c936118cc296f6ff75a95f37.poster.avif?t=1741358678\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/b04e52e2c936118cc296f6ff75a95f37.webm?t=1741358678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/b04e52e2c936118cc296f6ff75a95f37.mp4?t=1741358678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel adventure that progresses like a comic book with simple clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fancy and creepy world of fairy tales, vividly drawn in limited colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 cuts of illustrations (more than 60 pages in comic form!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 chapters in total. Chapter list and text history functions available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings, one branching point. Other choices do not affect the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time: approx. 30 minutes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hansel and Gretel are brother and sister from a poor family.<br>Abandoned, they find a Gingerbread House in the forest.<br>After they`re caught by a scary witch in the house, what is their fate...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/972768d6340fdd23f315227524ac9a37.poster.avif?t=1741358678\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/972768d6340fdd23f315227524ac9a37.webm?t=1741358678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/972768d6340fdd23f315227524ac9a37.mp4?t=1741358678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the true feelings of Gretel, that has never been focused before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/a52315f66efef92c001abc9f66597df0.avif?t=1741358678\" width=187 height=181 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gretel: A girl who is quiet for a reason. This game focuses on her inner life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hansel: Gretel's older brother. Kind-hearted and always thinking for Gretel`s sake.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Witch: The owner of the Gingerbread House. She uses terrifying magic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dad and Ma'am: The parents of Hansel and Gretel. Ma'am is the Dad's second marriage.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is covered under the sugar?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many hidden dark sides to fairy tales told all over the world. <br>This game presents a new story based on \u201cHansel and Gretel\u201d.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/b04e52e2c936118cc296f6ff75a95f37.poster.avif?t=1741358678\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/b04e52e2c936118cc296f6ff75a95f37.webm?t=1741358678\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3450100/extras/b04e52e2c936118cc296f6ff75a95f37.mp4?t=1741358678\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A visual novel adventure that progresses like a comic book with simple clicks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fancy and creepy world of fairy tales, vividly drawn in limited colors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 300 cuts of illustrations (more than 60 pages in comic form!).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 chapters in total. Chapter list and text history functions available.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two endings, one branching point. Other choices do not affect the story.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Estimated play time: approx. 30 minutes.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Storyline</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hansel and Gretel are brother and sister from a poor family.<br>Abandoned, they find a Gingerbread House in the forest.<br>After they`re caught by a scary witch in the house, what is their fate...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"